    <panel_attributes>title=Plan and replan a savings goal
obj=User~User actor
obj=GoalsView / CliApp~UI
obj=WealthSeiFacade~F
obj=GoalService~GS
obj=GoalPlanner~GP
obj=AnalyticsService~AN
obj=AlertMonitor~AM
obj=ProposalService~PS
User-&gt;UI : add goal (name, target, deadline, saved)
UI-&gt;F : addGoal(request, today)
F-&gt;GS : createGoal(request, today)
GS-&gt;GS : save goal (GoalRepository)
GS-&gt;AN : monthly surplus (MonthlySurplusProvider)
GS-&gt;GP : requiredMonthly / isFeasible / projectedCompletion
GS-&gt;AM : evaluateGoal(goal, required)
AM-&gt;&gt;UI : Alert if status got worse
F-&gt;&gt;UI : SavingsGoal with status
User-&gt;UI : replan
UI-&gt;F : getGoalFeasibility(id, today)
F-&gt;GS : feasibility(id, today)
GS-&gt;GP : buildOptions(goal, surplus, today)
F-&gt;&gt;UI : FeasibilityReport (options)
User-&gt;UI : suggest a fix
UI-&gt;F : proposeGoalFix(id, today)
F-&gt;PS : createFromDrafts(draft: set monthly amount)
PS-&gt;&gt;UI : pending Proposal (approve in F13)</panel_attributes>
